{"title":"Rock Scorpion","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 29 Scorpion that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: carapaceFlat: 2 | venomChance: .3 | venomDamage: 12</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/deathstalker-venom\">Deathstalker Venom</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-374.6px,-679.6px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/1/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:768px\"><i style=\"left:303.9px;top:639.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:291.5px;top:650.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:286.7px;top:624.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:324.5px;top:658.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:360.3px;top:661.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:381.6px;top:676.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:372.6px;top:676.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:399.4px;top:688.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:359.6px;top:680.6px\"></i></div><figcaption>Old Thak Muster Ground</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Scorpion%20Pits\">Scorpion Pits</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Boneyard%20Roost\">Boneyard Roost</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"rock-scorpion\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Scorpion: <a href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion\">Dune Scorpion</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/deathstalker-scorpion\">Deathstalker Scorpion</a> <span class=\"muted\">(32)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/5872f1ca65b47d6d3732.svg\" alt=\"Rock Scorpion\"></div><h3>Rock Scorpion</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>29 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 29–32)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Scorpion</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>111</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>20.5</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1450</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>17 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}